description	"Phase III Dark Trooper

Large, heavy-hitting and heavily armored droid units with Jetpacks.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Assault Cannon (Bowcaster 3)
-- 10% more damage
-- 5% faster RoF
- Assault Cannon Rocket Attachment (12) (RL)
-- Pushes on hit
-- 25% more velocity
-- 25% slower RoF
-- 60% slower reload

^8Attributes:
- Strength (2)
- Climate Shielding (1)
- Beskar (3)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Impact Diffusion
- Wookalike
- 10% more knockback given
- 10% less knockback taken

^3Abilities:
- Jetpack"